{"ticker":"JNJ","updated":"2026-10-23T23:11:09Z","profile":{"longName":"Johnson & Johnson","shortName":"Johnson & Johnson","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jnj.com","fullTimeEmployees":138200,"marketCap":635072544768,"trailingPE":40.031864,"forwardPE":22.707983,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.393241,"pegRatio":2.96,"targetMeanPrice":279.4091,"targetHighPrice":320.0,"targetLowPrice":190.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.059,"earningsGrowth":-0.96,"grossMargins":0.67754996,"operatingMargins":0.25059998,"profitMargins":0.16203,"totalRevenue":99334995968,"beta":0.206,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":281.07,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":184.66,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.0},"summary":"Johnson & Johnson, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the research and development, manufacture, and sale of a range of products in the healthcare field worldwide. It operates in two segments, Innovative Medicine and MedTech. The Innovative Medicine segment offers products for various therapeutic areas, such as oncology, immunology, neuroscience, pulmonary hypertension, infectious diseases, and cardiovascular and metabolism distributed through retailers, wholesalers, distributors, hospitals, and healthcare professionals for prescription use. The MedTech segment provides a portfolio of products used in the surgery, orthopedic, cardiovascular, and vision fields distributed through wholesalers, hospitals and retailers, and used in the professional fields by physicians, nurses, hospitals, eye care professionals and clinics. This segment also offers products and enabling technologies that support joint reconstruction, trauma, spine, sports related injuries, and others, as well as open, laparoscopic, and robotic surgical procedures; instrumentation, energy devices, stapling systems, wound closure, biosurgery products, and digital and robotic technologies; breast aesthetics and reconstruction; contact lenses under the ACUVUE brand; intraocular lenses for cataract surgery, and other products used in cataract and refractive procedures under the TECNIS brand. The company was foun","summary_zh":"強生公司及其子公司在全球範圍內從事醫療保健領域一系列產品的研發、製造和銷售。它分為兩個部門：創新醫學和醫療技術。創新醫學部門提供各種治療領域的產品，例如腫瘤學、免疫學、神經科學、肺動脈高壓、傳染病以及心血管和新陳代謝，透過零售商、批發商、分銷商、醫院和醫療保健專業人員分銷以供處方使用。醫療科技部門提供用於外科、骨科、心血管和視力領域的產品組合，透過批發商、醫院和零售商分銷，並由醫生、護士、醫院、眼科護理專業人員和診所用於專業領域。該部門還提供支援關節重建、創傷、脊柱、運動相關損傷等的產品和支援技術，以及開放、腹腔鏡和機器人外科手術；儀器儀表、能源設備、縫合系統、傷口閉合、生物外科產品以及數位和機器人技術；乳房美學與重建； ACUVUE品牌隱形眼鏡；用於白內障手術的人工晶狀體產品，以及 TECNIS 障品牌下手術的其他和其他屈光。公司被發現","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":179.52,"h":180.26,"l":178.29,"c":178.41,"v":6229100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":176.75,"h":177.16,"l":175.77,"c":176.49,"v":9145000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":176.97,"h":177.69,"l":176.16,"c":176.79,"v":5951100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":176.37,"h":176.49,"l":174.63,"c":175.45,"v":6424700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":175.97,"h":177.41,"l":175.45,"c":177.17,"v":6942300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":177.47,"h":179.2,"l":176.89,"c":178.06,"v":9049000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":177.67,"h":178.29,"l":176.53,"c":178.0,"v":7111700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":178.0,"h":178.9,"l":177.55,"c":178.76,"v":7854800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":178.0,"h":179.51,"l":176.56,"c":178.43,"v":9733800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":177.36,"h":179.45,"l":176.7,"c":178.13,"v":8382500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":178.0,"h":178.09,"l":176.45,"c":176.96,"v":6005700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":176.3,"h":176.61,"l":174.33,"c":175.79,"v":6891600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":175.75,"h":178.85,"l":175.63,"c":178.5,"v":5792500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":177.71,"h":178.8,"l":176.72,"c":178.06,"v":7220200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":177.76,"h":178.99,"l":176.93,"c":177.4,"v":4768100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":177.57,"h":177.62,"l":175.65,"c":176.46,"v":7959300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":176.71,"h":178.51,"l":176.59,"c":177.2,"v":6714900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":176.6,"h":177.02,"l":173.87,"c":174.